00:05:24.073 --> 00:05:27.994
There are others like the Rattlesnakes,
 the Pirates and the Buffalo Soldiers

00:05:27.994 --> 00:05:30.788
that we know a lot less about. 

00:05:33.082 --> 00:05:36.878
[Protesters shouting] Jail Killer Cops!

00:05:36.878 --> 00:05:40.798
Without that badge you ain't nothing!

00:05:40.798 --> 00:05:42.425
Wihtout that badge
 you ain't nothing mutherfuckers! 

